  "content": "\n\n<hr>\n<h2 style=\"text-align:center\"><strong>歡迎來到 OnePieceC</strong></h2>\n<p>這是一個 OnePieceC 整合包，新增了優質功能並提供更佳的遊戲體驗</p>\n<p>扮演魯夫及其夥伴，探索無垠大海</p>\n<hr>\n<h2><strong>系統需求</strong></h2>\n<p>客戶端-&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;伺服器-</p>\n<p>6GB 記憶體&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; 6GB 記憶體</p>\n<p>i5 第7代&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; i5 第7代</p>\n<p>4GB 記憶體亦可使用</p>\n<hr>\n<h2><strong>多人遊戲</strong></h2>\n<p>若要無需架設伺服器即可進行多人遊戲，請使用 <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/essential-mod\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Essential Mod</a></p>\n<p><span><span><iframe src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/HhL7E8-fcGQ?wmode=transparent\" width=\"638\" height=\"358\" allowfullscreen=\"allowfullscreen\"></iframe></span></span></p>\n<div class=\"spoiler\">\n<p>1. 對區域網路開放</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/968909/description_2e9b0a44-8bc9-4779-bcd5-a58e53e8cc04.png\"></p>\n<p>2. 聊天視窗應會出現此訊息</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/968909/description_36024ac8-4b6c-4217-a1a1-6d9435e135c9.png\"></p>\n<p>3. 將網域貼上至「直接連線」標籤並連線</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/968909/description_f5080941-38d7-48e4-8462-8dd882502ea9.png\"></p>\n</div>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<hr>\n<h2><strong>功能特色</strong></h2>\n<p>本整合包包含的功能如下：-</p>\n<ul>\n<li>航海王模組</li>\n<li>家具</li>\n<li>大量新生物群系</li>\n<li>自動化科技</li>\n<li>更優化的介面</li>\n<li>各項品質提升細節</li>\n<li>效能優化</li>\n</ul>\n<p>還有更多內容...</p>",
